  question1: Why do you think you'd be a good fit for this position?
  answer1: I'm willing to learn and I'm ready to work hard.
  answer2: I just need any job I can get.
  answer3: I don't think the work will be very difficult.
  answer4: My friends told me I should apply.
  question2: What would you do if you were given a task you didn't know how to complete?
  question2Answer1: I'd ask for help, learn what I need, and try again.
  question2Answer2: I'd probably leave it until someone else did it.
  question2Answer3: I'd say the task was too difficult.
  question2Answer4: I'd pretend I knew how to do it.
  question3: If you were asked to complete an important task by a certain deadline,
    what would you do?
  question3Answer1: I'd plan my time carefully and make sure the task was completed
    on time.
  question3Answer2: I'd wait until the deadline was close before starting.
  question3Answer3: I'd ask someone else to do it for me.
  question3Answer4: I'd do it when I had enough time.
  answerTime: 10
  feedbackDuration: 2
